  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds native, deterministic MADR 4.0 generation to adr-guard new with minimal and extended templates.\nSupports explicit or configured format selection, side-effect-free preview and dry-run, and the existing schema 1.0 structured form contract.\nPreserves canonical generation by default, atomic writes, concurrent ID allocation, and human-owned ADR approval.\nFull release notes: https://github.com/rodri-oliveira-dev/adr-guard/releases/tag/v1.11.0",
